  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;GUY MIDDLETON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Guy Middleton is a renowned British actor born in 1907 and passed away in 1973, with connections to both the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland and Italy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED KINGDOM OF GREAT BRITAIN AND IRELAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland was a historical sovereign state that existed from 1801 to 1922, comprising England, Scotland, Wales, and Ireland."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LONDON, ENGLAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"London, England is the birthplace of Guy Middleton and a hub for British theatre during the early 20th century."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KING EDWARD VII&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"King Edward VII reigned during Guy Middleton's birth year, 1907, and was the monarch of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. LUCY WORSLEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Lucy Worsley is a leading historian and curator at Historic Royal Palaces who corroborates the findings about Guy Middleton's citizenship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HISTORIC ROYAL PALACES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Historic Royal Palaces is an organization where Dr. Lucy Worsley works and provides historical context about Guy Middleton's citizenship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UK CENSUS OF 1911&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The UK Census of 1911 lists Guy Middleton as a resident of London, supporting his citizenship status."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIR IAN MCKELLEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sir Ian McKellen is a renowned actor and contemporary of Guy Middleton who shares thoughts on the discovery of Middleton's citizenship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JULIA MIDDLETON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Julia Middleton is the daughter of Guy Middleton and shares insights about her father's Italian roots."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITALIAN NATIONAL ARCHIVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Italian National Archives contain documents that reveal Guy Middleton's dual citizenship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MILAN, ITALY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Milan, Italy is the birthplace of Guy Middleton and where he spent his formative years, developing a deep affection for the country and its culture."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. ALESSANDRO BIANCHI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Alessandro Bianchi is a historian who researches Guy Middleton's life and provides insights into his Italian upbringing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUOMO IN MILAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Duomo in Milan is a landmark featured in a photograph of Guy Middleton and his family, showcasing his connection to Italy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE MAN IN THE WHITE SUIT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Man in the White Suit is a film in which Guy Middleton starred, highlighting his career in British cinema."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE DAM BUSTERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Dam Busters is another film in which Guy Middleton starred, further emphasizing his prominence in British entertainment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARK HARRIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mark Harris is a film critic and historian who comments on the potential influence of Middleton's dual nationality on his acting abilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mark Harris is a film critic and historian who discusses the potential influence of Guy Middleton's cultural heritage on his performances."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROME, ITALY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rome, Italy is the city where the discovery of Guy Middleton's Italian roots was revealed."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRITISH EXPAT COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The British expat community in Italy during the early 20th century included Guy Middleton's family."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITALIAN ROOTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Italian roots refer to Guy Middleton's connection to Italy, including his birthplace and formative years."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUAL CITIZENSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dual citizenship refers to Guy Middleton's status as a citizen of both the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland and Italy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EARLY 20TH CENTURY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME PERIOD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The early 20th century is the time period during which Guy Middleton lived and his family moved to Italy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FILM INDUSTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The film industry is the sector in which Guy Middleton worked, starring in films like 'The Man in the White Suit' and 'The Dam Busters'."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRITISH THEATRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"British theatre is the sector in which Guy Middleton performed on stage in London's West End."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MIDDLETON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Middleton is an actor known for bringing depth and nuance to his characters, and his dual nationality might have influenced his performances."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUAL NATIONALITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dual nationality refers to Middleton's private status of having citizenship in two countries, which may have influenced his performances."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The actor is known for his dual nationality and performances, which are influenced by his unique cultural heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FILM CRITIC AND HISTORIAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mark Harris is a film critic and historian who comments on the potential influence of the actor's dual nationality on his acting abilities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PERFORMANCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The actor's performances are noted for their depth and nuance, possibly influenced by his dual nationality."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRIVATE MATTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The actor's dual nationality is a private matter known only to his closest family and friends."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLOSEST FAMILY AND FRIENDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The closest family and friends are the ones who know about the actor's dual nationality."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0338</data>
    </node>
